:rgba(37,99,235,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;\">Card & Table View</span><span style=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(37,99,235,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;\">Advanced Search</span><span style=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(16,185,129,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#10b981;\">Detail Panel</span><span style=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(139,92,246,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;\">Details Dialog</span><span style=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(245,158,11,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">Type Badge</span></div></div></div></div>"
